ng the VPNService API. This results in a different routing configuration than on other OSes. 
The configuration of the VPN tunnel consists of the IP address and the networks that should be routed over this interface. Especially\, no peer partner address or gateway address is needed or required. Special routes to reach the VPN Server (for example added when using redirect-gateway) are not needed either. The application will consequently ignore these settings when importing a configuration. The app ensures with the VPNService API that the connection to the server is not routed through the VPN tunnel.
The VPNService API does not allow specifying networks that should not be routed via the VPN. As a workaround the app tries to detect networks that should not be routed over tunnel (e.g. route x.x.x.x y.y.y.y net_gateway) and calculates a set of routes that excludes this routes to emulate the behaviour of other platforms. The log windows shows the configuration of the VPNService upon establishing a connection.
Behind the scenes\: Android 4.4\+ does use policy routing. Using route/ifconfig will not show the installed routes. Instead use ip rule\, iptables -t mangle -L";ab_tethering_44,60,V40166986f,82016698ed,;"Tethering works while the VPN is active. The tethered connection will NOT use the VPN.";error_reading_config_file,60,V4008c304e,4f008c3099,;"Error reading config file";internal_web_view,60,V401ecd3f3,3e01ecd42d,;"Internal WebView";faq_tap_mode,60,V400752625,92007526b3,;"Tap Mode is not possible with the non root VPN API. Therefore this application cannot provide tap support";ignore,60,V400cf52f0,2900cf5315,;"Ignore";volume_byte,60,V401bcbef6,2e01bcbf20,;"%.0f B";file_icon,60,V400a43eb4,2f00a43edf,;"file icon";no_vpn_profiles_defined,60,V400d6570a,4c00d65752,;"No VPN profiles defined.";copyright_others,60,V4001504ac,8d00150535,;"This program uses the following components\; see the source code for full details on the licenses";send_minidump,60,V400e96788,4400e967c8,;"Send Minidump to developer";custom_options_title,60,V4005e1de7,3f005e1e22,;"Custom Options";send_minidump_summary,60,V400ea67ce,6b00ea6835,;"Sends debugging information about last crash to developer";start_vpn_title,60,V401006d73,4001006daf,;"Connecting to VPN %s";apprest_remoteaidl,1,V4005c1bc0,40005c1bfc,;"Remote API access";pauseVPN,60,V4011f7964,2e011f798e,;"Pause VPN";change_sorting,60,V401a4b876,3901a4b8ab,;"Change sorting";openurl_requested,60,V401dccb6e,5501dccbbf,;"Open URL to continue VPN authentication";getproxy_error,60,V400c950d1,4b00c95118,;"Error getting proxy settings\: %s";prompt,60,V4011473a9,40011473e5,;"%1$s attempts to control %2$s";remote_tlscn_check_title,60,V400431351,4f0043139c,;"Certificate Hostname Check";dnsserver_ignore_dnsport,60,V40206e50f,8a0206e595,;"Skipping address %1$s\:%2$d for DNS server entry %1$d as uses a non-default port\: %2$s";confirmations_summary,60,V4020ae6da,c6020ae79c,;"(Not recommended) Disables confirmations when connecting/disconnecting VPN. This disable